Name: mac-calendar-bridge
Version: 0.2.0
Summary: Mac Calendar bridge for Homunculus/Herman — watches vault/calendar/ and pushes schedule events to Calendar.app via AppleScript. Reminder events (handle/remind) are handled by mac_reminders_bridge.
